{"title":"Debate scholarships","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Entering_Freshman\">Entering Freshman</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Debate_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Entering Freshman\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Baylor_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Baylor University (page does not exist)\">Baylor University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.baylor.edu/comm_studies/index.php?id=2901\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Carthage&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Carthage (page does not exist)\">Carthage</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.carthage.edu/admissions/scholarships/debate1.cfm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Concordia&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Concordia (page does not exist)\">Concordia</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www4.cord.edu/csta/forensics/scholarships/applicationform.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Emory_College_Alben_W._Barkley_Debate_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Emory College Alben W. Barkley Debate Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Emory College Alben W. Barkley Debate Scholarship</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.college.emory.edu/current/achievement/scholars/prospective.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=George_Mason_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"George Mason University (page does not exist)\">George Mason University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.gmu.edu\">[1]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Idaho_State_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Idaho State University (page does not exist)\">Idaho State University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.isu.edu/departments/debate/scholarships.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lewis_and_Clark_College&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lewis and Clark College (page does not exist)\">Lewis and Clark College</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.lclark.edu/org/forensic/forensicsfaq.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Loyola_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Loyola University (page does not exist)\">Loyola University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.luc.edu/finaid/scholarships_loyola.shtml\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=McKendree&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"McKendree (page does not exist)\">McKendree</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mckendree.edu/prospective/financial_aid/first_year_scholarships.aspx\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northwestern_University_Hardy_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Northwestern University Hardy Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Northwestern University Hardy Scholarships</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.debate.northwestern.edu/overview/hardy/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southern_Illinois_University-Carbondale&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Southern Illinois University-Carbondale (page does not exist)\">Southern Illinois University-Carbondale</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.siu.edu/~cola/LiberalArtsScholarships.html#SPCM\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wi